","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch’s rubber-band bounds, and pulses Reset when both position axes are within the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placed graph’s 100-point center tolerance.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"}}}